   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help Us Keep the Lights On!!</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Fundraising Appeal From Tiny Toones. Like many others providing social services to the most vulnerable, we have been hit hard by Covid-19. At a time when our students are in most need, our funding sources have decreased drastically. With our funders and supporters feeling the impacts of the pandemic, our online donations and merchandise sales down and we are facing the biggest challenge in over 18 of operating. We urgently need your support to keep the centre open. Every dollar helps.</narrative>
  </description>
